CM_ SG_ 2147548920 TrnsmssnOlLvl1CntdwnTmr "Transmission Oil Level 1 Countdown Timer: Countdown timer for the first instance of a transmission oil level indicator.  Once all vehicle conditions (such as vehicle stopped, etc) are met, some transmissions may require a 'settling time' to allow the...";
CM_ SG_ 2147548920 TransmissionOilLevel1HighLow "Transmission Oil Level 1 High / Low: First instance of a transmission oil level indicator. When SPN 3026 [Transmission Oil Level 1 Measurement Status] indicates state 0000b [Conditions valid for transmission oil level measurement] or SPN 3026 is not ...";
CM_ SG_ 2147548920 TransmissionOilTemperature1 "Transmission Oil Temperature 1: First instance of transmission lubricant temperature.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548920 Transmission1OilPressure "Transmission 1 Oil Pressure: Gage pressure of lubrication fluid in transmission 1, measured after pump.";
