CM_ SG_ 2147548920 TransmissionOilLevel1 "Transmission Oil Level 1: First instance of a transmission oil level indicator. Conveys the ratio of volume of transmission sump oil to recommended volume.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548920 TransmissionClutch1Pressure "Transmission Clutch 1 Pressure: Gage pressure of oil within a wet clutch.";
